  "limits": "Reused development features and unchanged21-point grid/gates. Compare binary and product from the identical dual INT8 invocation; parent scalar output is context only because PTQ changed. New CTC head saw background negatives, but this experiment does not isolate the causal effect of background supervision without a second dual export. Original full feature bytes and training/development background payloads stay bound. Pointwise product dominance does not imply monotonic latched-event counts. Absolute CTC likelihood is not calibrated human wake confidence. Full-history head is an unoptimized correctness reference, with unmeasured P4 cost, memory and physical latency. No fitting, threshold extension, validation-residual training, final/test scoring, source WAV reading, playback, microphone, board/OTA, production device, PCM speed or audio producer change."
